Z||000015||Urchin||06-10-2001||12:36 PM||||I really would not want them to bring the fiero back!  As much as I think it would be neat to see what they would do with it, I also know I woul;d probably not like it.  Plus, all that would do is bring attention to the car and open the door for every ricer in the world to a new car to butcher.  I also like the idea that fiero was only made for a few years, you don't see them all the time, which makes me feel like one of the luckt ones.  So, no, I won't be cashing my vote <P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/signature2_3.jpg">   <P>If you can read this, I'm parked.||||reg||1
